  "hero_headline": "AI 行业面临盈利重估与信任挑战 / AI Industry Faces Profitability Re-evaluation and Trust Hurdles",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球焦点集中在科技与财经的深度耦合：科技侧，AI Agent 正在改变企业的生产范式，但关于模型监控与算力投入的讨论愈发理性；财经侧，Alphabet 与 Intel 等巨头因 AI 转型成本与业绩预警导致市值波动，全球资本市场正在重新审视 AI 的造血能力；时政侧，西班牙火车事故与中东局势升级引发国际关注，地缘冲突对全球经济韧性的挑战持续存在。\n\nToday's global focus centers on the deep coupling of tech and finance: In tech, AI agents are reshaping production paradigms, though discourse on model monitoring and compute investment is becoming more pragmatic. On the financial front, giants like Alphabet and Intel face market volatility due to the costs of AI transformation and earnings warnings, prompting a re-evaluation of AI's revenue-generating capability. Politically, the train crash in Spain and escalating Middle East tensions have captured international attention, highlighting the ongoing challenges geopolitical conflicts pose to global economic resilience.",
