  "editor_note": "本周市场对 AI 的狂热开始回归理性，资本更关注「投入产出比」。普通人应警惕纯靠 AI 概念的泡沫，转而培养不可替代的业务判断力。\n\nMarket enthusiasm for AI is turning pragmatic, with capital focusing on ROI. Ordinary people should beware of AI bubbles and prioritize building irreplaceable business judgment.",
